## 6. Dependency Resolution

### Automatic Resolution

**Framework Resolves Dependencies**:
```csharp
// Controller constructor
public VesselController(
    ILogger<VesselController> logger,
    IMaritimeDataService maritimeDataService)  // ✅ Automatically resolved
    : base(logger)
{
    _maritimeDataService = maritimeDataService;
}
```

**Service Constructor**:
```csharp
public MaritimeDataService(
    ILogger<MaritimeDataService> logger)  // ✅ Automatically resolved
{
    _logger = logger;
}
```

### Manual Resolution (Avoid)

**Service Locator Pattern** (not recommended):
```csharp
var service = serviceProvider.GetService<IVesselService>();  // ❌ Avoid
```

**Why Avoid**:
- Hides dependencies
- Harder to test
- Less explicit
- Violates dependency inversion

